NNAAMMEE
     aaww__ssiidd — driver for the SID controller in Allwinner SoC

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaww__ssiidd device driver provides support for the Allwinner SID (Security
     ID) controller.  This controller provides root security keys that may be
     used as either a device unique ID or to generate a MAC address.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The aaww__ssiidd driver supports the SID controller with one of the following
     compatible strings:

     ••   allwinner,sun4i-a10-sid
     ••   allwinner,sun7i-a20-sid
     ••   allwinner,sun50i-a64-sid
     ••   allwinner,sun8i-a83t-sid
     ••   allwinner,sun8i-h3-sid

SSYYSSCCTTLL VVAARRIIAABBLLEESS
     The following read-only variables are available via sysctl(8):

     _d_e_v_._a_w___s_i_d_._r_o_o_t_k_e_y
             Root security key for this device.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The aaww__ssiidd device driver first appeared in FreeBSD 11.0.

